    "# 🚀 Intelligent-AML: Gold-Standard IEEE TIFS Master Benchmark & Empirical Testing Suite\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target Venue:** IEEE Transactions on Information Forensics and Security (TIFS) / ACM KDD  \n",
    "**Target Hardware:** NVIDIA Tesla T4 $\\times$ 2 GPU (16 GB VRAM) | 30 GB System RAM  \n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ **IMPORTANT ACCELERATOR NOTE:**  \n",
    "> In Kaggle's right-hand sidebar under **Notebook Settings** -> **Accelerator**, make sure you select **GPU T4 x 2** (NOT P100).\n",
    "> Modern PyTorch dropped support for the older Pascal `sm_60` architecture on P100. Tesla T4 uses `sm_75`, which is 100% supported, has hardware Tensor Cores, and runs significantly faster!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
