   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Part 7: Phase 2 — Complete 24 Master Empirical Algorithmic Tests\n",
    "Executes the full 24-dimensional empirical evaluation suite defined in `scripts/run_24_master_empirical_tests.py`:\n",
    "1. Zero-Shot Cross-Dataset Transfer Test\n",
    "2. Leave-One-Out Component Ablation Test\n",
    "3. Calibration Set Size Sensitivity Test\n",
    "4. Conformal Coverage Validity Test\n",
    "5. Entity Overlap & Temporal Leakage Audit\n",
    "6. Cold-Start / Zero-Degree Node Test\n",
    "7. Adversarial Camouflage Injection Robustness Test\n",
    "8. Hyperparameter Sensitivity Sweep\n",
    "9. Multiple Random Seed Variance Test (5 Seeds)\n",
    "10. Training Convergence Test\n",
    "11. Compute Cost / Training Time Benchmark\n",
    "12. Latency & Memory Stress Test\n",
    "13. Statistical Significance Testing (Wilcoxon, Friedman)\n",
    "14. Multiple-Comparison Correction (Holm-Bonferroni)\n",
    "15. Class-Conditional Cost-Sensitive Analysis\n",
    "16. Threshold Sensitivity Test\n",
    "17. Concept Drift / Temporal Shift Test (DER++)\n",
    "18. Synthetic Typology Generalization Test\n",
    "19. Feature Ablation Test\n",
    "20. Noise & Missing-Data Robustness Test\n",
    "21. Cross-Institution / Federated Simulation\n",
    "22. Explainability Faithfulness Test\n",
    "23. Compliance Human Evaluation on SAR Narratives\n",
    "24. Fairness / Bias Audit across Volume & Geography"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from scripts.run_24_master_empirical_tests import Master24EmpiricalSuite\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 80)\n",
    "print(\" EXECUTING COMPLETE 24 MASTER EMPIRICAL EVALUATIONS\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 80)\n",
    "empirical_suite = Master24EmpiricalSuite()\n",
    "empirical_suite.run_all_with_resumption()\n",
    "print(\"\\n✓ All 24 Master Empirical Tests completed successfully!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
